---
title: About
---

I'm Jean-Philippe Lejeune. I write about finance, institutions, and the
architecture of independent intellectual work. I build systems on the side ---
mostly small, self-hosted, plain-text.

If something I wrote is useful or wrong, [say so](mailto:jp@astuscg.com). I
read every email. I do not have a newsletter. The [RSS feed](/feed.xml) is
the subscription.
